# Background Images Directory

This directory contains background images for the featured games carousel.

## Expected Files:

- kings-quest-bg.jpg (1920x1080 recommended)
- space-quest-bg.jpg (1920x1080 recommended)
- police-quest-bg.jpg (1920x1080 recommended)
- quest-for-glory-bg.jpg (1920x1080 recommended)
- leisure-suit-larry-bg.jpg (1920x1080 recommended)
- other-games-bg.jpg (1920x1080 recommended)

## Usage:

Images are automatically loaded based on the game's series code from the database.
If an image doesn't exist, the system falls back to gradient backgrounds.

## Format:

- Preferred format: JPG or WebP for best performance
- Resolution: 1920x1080 (Full HD) recommended
- File size: Keep under 500KB for good loading performance
